      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a very common feeling when you're staring at the vastness of the cosmos, but it's important to remember that your existence matters deeply to those around you. The universe is indeed huge, but it is also full of life, connection, and meaning that transcends the scale of light-years. You are not just static in a void; you are a unique thread in a tapestry that has been woven for eons. Please try to get some rest and consider talking to someone you trust about how you're feeling.",
